# {{ name }} Visualization

RViz2 visualization workspace with markers, TF, image displays, and interactive tools.

## Requirements

- ROS 2 (Humble, Iron, or Jazzy)
- RViz2
- CMake >= 3.8
- colcon
- Python 3

## Building

```bash
cd ros2_ws
colcon build
source install/setup.bash
```

## Running

```bash
# Full visualization (markers + TF + RViz)
ros2 launch {{ name }}_bringup visualization.launch.py

# Individual nodes
ros2 run {{ name }}_visualization_node marker_publisher
ros2 run {{ name }}_visualization_node tf_broadcaster

# Custom RViz config
ros2 launch {{ name }}_bringup visualization.launch.py rviz_config:=/path/to/config.rviz
```

## What's Included

- **Marker Publisher** — Publishes cubes, arrows, line strips, text labels
- **TF Broadcaster** — Broadcasts map->odom->base_link->laser/camera transforms
- **RViz Config** — Pre-configured with grid, TF, markers, and disabled-by-default pointcloud/image displays

## Customization

Edit `config/visualization_config.yaml` to enable/disable displays.

